{"id":"vod_md_3617","vodId":"3617","provider":"md","providerName":"魔都动漫","type":2,"name":"绝园的暴风雨","name_cn":"绝园的暴风雨","date":"2012-01-01","year":"2012","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"24集全","images":{"common":"https://www.mdzypic.com/upload/vod/20230829-1/ea471bf7bbef817910356debc333cf99.jpg"},"summary":"魔法使一族的野心使他们为了获取更强的力量，促使他们唤醒了不该唤醒的东西，世界的毁灭近在眼前。只有最强的魔法使公主锁部叶风（泽城美雪 配音）才能阻止这一切的发生，但被部下锁部左门（小山力也 配音）暗算的叶风被困在了施了结界的无人岛上。高中二年级学生泷川吉野（内山昂辉 配音）的好友不破真广（丰永利行 配音）的妹妹不破爱花（花泽香菜 配音）被入室抢劫犯所杀，但是真广却认为妹妹的死疑点重重。为了调查妹妹的死因，真广通过海上的漂流人偶和锁部叶风达成秘密交易。真广在失踪一个月后，在大雪的冬日伴随着漫天的蝴蝶突然从天而降。与此同时，可怕的“黑铁病”在整个日本蔓延开来。真广到底和魔法使公主结下了什么样的契约，而他到底带着怎样的使命来到这个世界？","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-08-29 01:37:25","playable":true,"episodeCount":24,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"modum3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230826/DJJRIkyL/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230826/99SM3WsL/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230826/pOQnvbOi/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230826/Vbu1mzKu/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230826/XikWJ4B1/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230826/JPaIj9xu/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230826/EUp0CMHJ/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230826/TEHeb9ie/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230826/Brk8wsNp/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230826/VfesrG3G/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230826/S97cxjiN/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230826/XtLsks77/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230826/lUa7HxTZ/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230826/WlhjQB79/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/202308